---
description: Cypress-to-Playwright migration and Playwright Test conventions. Apply when editing Cypress or Playwright files.
globs:
  - playwright/**/*
  - cypress/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`. Do not contradict it.

- Convert Cypress → `skills/cypress-to-playwright-migration/SKILL.md`
- Write or heal Playwright → `skills/playwright-testing/SKILL.md`
- After a completed change → isolated `skills/code-review` with a git range (new chat / subagent)

Locators: `getByRole` > `getByLabel` > `getByPlaceholder` > `getByText` > `getByTestId` > `locator()`.
No `cy.*` in `playwright/`. No `page.waitForTimeout`. Auth via `storageState` or fixtures.
